### 1. Public: List published projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects

### 2. Public: Filter projects by category
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?category=Web&page=1&limit=9

### 3. Public: Filter featured projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects?featured=true

### 4. Public: Retrieve project statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/stats

### 5. Public: Retrieve a project by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}

### 6. Public: Invalid project ID should fail validation
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/not-a-valid-id

### 7. Admin: List all projects without logging in
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/admin

### 8. Admin: Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "YOUR_ADMIN_EMAIL",
    "password": "YOUR_ADMIN_PASSWORD"
}

### 9. Admin: List all projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/admin
Cookie: accessToken={{adminToken}}

### 10. Admin: Retrieve administrative statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/admin/stats
Cookie: accessToken={{adminToken}}

### 11. Admin: Create a project
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/admin
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: accessToken={{adminToken}}

{
    "name": "Project API Test",
    "description": "A temporary project created to test the Project API.",
    "githubUrl": "https://github.com/example/project-api-test",
    "liveUrl": "https://example.com",
    "primaryLanguage": "JavaScript",
    "techStack": ["React", "Node.js"],
    "topics": ["testing", "portfolio"],
    "category": "Web",
    "stars": 0,
    "forks": 0,
    "pinned": false,
    "displayOrder": 0,
    "featured": false,
    "published": false
}

### 12. Admin: Update a project
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/projects/admin/{{projectId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "description": "Updated description for the Project API test.",
    "displayOrder": 1, 
    "published": true
}

### 13. Admin: Delete a project
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/admin/{{projectId}}

### 14. Admin: Invalid project ID should fail validation
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/admin/not-a-valid-id